    "profile_text": {
        "body": "RICHTECH ROBOTICS INC. is recorded as a public company headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada, with the ticker RR and a CIK of 0001963685. The website associated with the company in the record is rolls-royce.com, and the text drawn from that site describes Rolls-Royce as a developer and deliverer of complex power and propulsion solutions for safety-critical applications in the air, at sea and on land. The site says the business has been at the forefront of innovation for more than 100 years and describes work to power, protect and connect the modern world.\n\nThe site material reports several investments and partnerships. It states that Rolls-Royce invested 300 million pounds in UK manufacturing and engineering facilities to drive aerospace and defence growth, that it completed a $1 Billion investment in Indiana, and that Reliance Industries and Rolls-Royce announced a strategic intent to partner on developing India's indigenous combat engine for the Advanced Medium Combat Aircraft (AMCA) programme. It also states that Rolls-Royce, the United Kingdom National Nuclear Laboratory and the Japan Atomic Energy Agency will co-operate on advanced nuclear technologies.\n\nThe record holds no tracked products, no lawsuits, and no MCP servers for this company. Its law exposure is recorded in Nevada with a count of zero.",
